    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'WASD - move camera

    Right drag - pan the map

    Scroll - zoom in
    and out

    1-9 - pick building, R - rotate

    G - toggle grid lines

    Left
    click - build (hold to drag)

    Right click - remove

    Click a cook girl
    to swap recipe

    Esc / Q - cancel'
